{"id":"a9d34eb4089bd6fc","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-comb8-morass-level.md","title":"ZFC Comb8 Morass Level","display":"df-zfc-comb8-morass-level — ZFC Comb8 Morass Level","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb8-morass-level","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb8-morass-level"],"display":"df-zfc-comb8-morass-level — ZFC Comb8 Morass Level","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb8-morass-level"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-morass-level</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb8-morass-level — ZFC Comb8 Morass Level"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F,f,\\eta,\\xi\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F,f,\\eta,\\xi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\langle\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F\\rangle\">\\(M=\\langle\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8MorassLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8MorassLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}morass\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8MorassLevel}_S(M,\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nM=\\langle\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\theta,\\theta)\n\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\theta\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\eta\\;\nf(\\xi)\\in f(\\eta)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}morass\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8MorassLevel}_S(M,\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nM=\\langle\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\theta,\\theta)\n\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\theta\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\eta\\;\nf(\\xi)\\in f(\\eta)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This predicate records a set-coded level datum with a family of strictly order-preserving self-maps.  Coherence between different levels belongs to the full morass predicate and is not silently asserted here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F,f,\\eta,\\xi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\langle\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8MorassLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}morass\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8MorassLevel}_S(M,\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nM=\\langle\\alpha,\\theta,\\mathcal F\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\theta,\\theta)\n\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\theta\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\eta\\;\nf(\\xi)\\in f(\\eta)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1284,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1714","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-comb8-morass-level.md|58-df-zfc-comb8-morass-level]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751"]}